WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:05.388
<v><b>Expert:</b></v> I think you should sit down together and talk about your dreams for the future,

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:08.036
and see if they are the same dreams.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.348
If they are, and you can see a future together,

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:14.923
then the first thing is for her to look for a job in London.

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:18.933
If she finds one, then maybe she can move there first,

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:22.774
and you can go at weekends and see how you feel about life there.

00:00:23.115 --> 00:00:24.606
<v><b>Nick:</b></v> Thanks a lot for that.

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.293
I think that’s really good advice.